</td>
                <td rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p>Medial tibial condyle</p>
</td>
                <td rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p>Knee flexion; hip extension; medial rotation of the tibia (with knee flexion)</p>
</td>
                <td rowspan="1" colspan="1">
